{"id":"9a092d4f955d4997","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-straightening.md","title":"Straightening","display":"df-straightening — Straightening","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-straightening","aliases":["58-df-straightening"],"display":"df-straightening — Straightening","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-bounded.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-straightening"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-straightening</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-straightening — Straightening"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55cdf0f023905c30\" href=\"?note=55cdf0f023905c30\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-bounded.md\">../batch05/58-df-bounded.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa),\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa),\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{str}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{str}:V\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bounded}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Bounded}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Straightening}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Straightening}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}straightening\\text{-}graph}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Straightening}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists g\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\kappa,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(g^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\to\\lambda\\subseteq\\mu\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}straightening\\text{-}graph}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Straightening}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists g\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\kappa,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(g^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\to\\lambda\\subseteq\\mu\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}straightening} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Straightening}_S(\\operatorname{str}(\\kappa),\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}straightening} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Straightening}_S(\\operatorname{str}(\\kappa),\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{str}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{str}(\\kappa)\\)</span> is the least cardinal indexing a partition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> into bounded fibers, exactly as specified by the displayed minimum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-bounded.md","status":"resolved","id":"55cdf0f023905c30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-bounded.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa),\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa),\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{str}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bounded}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Straightening}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}straightening\\text{-}graph}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Straightening}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists g\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\kappa,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(g^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\to\\lambda\\subseteq\\mu\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}straightening} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Straightening}_S(\\operatorname{str}(\\kappa),\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{str}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1498,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-straightening.md|58-df-straightening]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751","55cdf0f023905c30"]}